<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 88, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 3 章 · 主循环</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>app_usart_run：指令分发中枢</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：左路由 SVG + 右说明 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 12, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 10, padding: '10px 12px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <svg width='536' height='420' viewBox='0 0 536 420' style={{ display: 'block' }}>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id='bh' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='0'><stop offset='0%' stopColor='#3B82F6' /><stop offset='100%' stopColor='#06B6D4' /></linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <rect x='20' y='170' width='180' height='70' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='url(#bh)' strokeWidth='2.5' />
          <text x='110' y='200' fill='#FBBF24' fontSize='16' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>if(uart1_get_ok)</text>
          <text x='110' y='224' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle'>app_usart_run()</text>
          {/* switch 支路 */}
          <path d='M200 205 H250' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar)' />
          <g fontSize='15' fill='#E2E8F0'>
            {[['mode==1 → parse_cmd($)',30],['mode==2 → parse_action(#)',90],['mode==3 → parse_action({)',150],['mode==4 → save_action(<)',210],['mode==5 → parse_angle(S)',270]].map((p)=>(
              <g key={p[1]}>
                <path d='M250 205 H300' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                <path d={`M300 205 V${Number(p[1])+50} H340`} fill='none' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                <rect x='340' y={Number(p[1])+28} width='190' height='44' rx='6' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                <text x='435' y={Number(p[1])+55} textAnchor='middle'>{p[0]}</text>
              </g>
            ))}
          </g>
          {/* 收尾 */}
          <rect x='20' y='360' width='240' height='36' rx='6' fill='#0B1120' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='1.5' />
          <text x='140' y='383' fill='#FBBF24' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle'>uart1_mode=0; uart1_get_ok=0;</text>
          <defs><marker id='ar' markerWidth='10' markerHeight='10' refX='8' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L8,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' /></marker></defs>
        </svg>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          <span style={{ color: '#FBBF24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>app_usart_run()</span> 是主循环里最核心的分发器：当串口/手柄置好 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>uart1_get_ok=1</span>，它按 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>uart1_mode</span> 用 if-else 把帧交给对应解析函数。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>mode 2 与 mode 3 共用 parse_action</span>：单舵机 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>#</span> 与多路 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>&lcub;</span> 解析逻辑完全相同，只是帧的起止符不同。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>处理完必复位</span>：<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>uart1_mode=0; uart1_get_ok=0</span>，否则同一条指令会被反复执行。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          该函数本身不做任何舵机动作，只做「路由」——所有真正的逻辑都在下一页起的 5 个解析函数里。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>22 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
